            aOrbiterI = ((aOrbiterI + aOrbiterJ) + 0xFBB3382A5D0C5E62ULL) + aKeyRotateOrbiterUpdateSaltA[(((31U - aIndex) + 10U)) & S_SALT1];
            aOrbiterG = (aOrbiterG ^ aOrbiterI) ^ 0x32E53418DF16A765ULL;
            aOrbiterG = RotL64((aOrbiterG * 0x2CA73B3064E6ABCDULL), 51U);
            //
            aOrbiterH = (aOrbiterH + aOrbiterB) + 0xBEFE2360E9FAF841ULL;
            aOrbiterC = (aOrbiterC ^ aOrbiterH) ^ 0xC49EDFD04D0FE80FULL;
            aOrbiterC = RotL64((aOrbiterC * 0xB22AC6F32D6F1301ULL), 27U);
            //
            aOrbiterE = (aOrbiterE + aOrbiterH) + 0xEBE6F34CEC4366D9ULL;
            aOrbiterB = ((aOrbiterB ^ aOrbiterE) ^ 0xA0D9EA5FC2EFC0FDULL) ^ aKeyRotateOrbiterUpdateSaltE[((aIndex + 14U)) & S_SALT1];
            aOrbiterB = RotL64((aOrbiterB * 0x6BB7DC70CCF79F63ULL), 5U);
            //
            aOrbiterJ = (aOrbiterJ + aOrbiterG) + 0x677D2414DCF11DA9ULL;
            aOrbiterE = (aOrbiterE ^ aOrbiterJ) ^ 0xA2361840ED27C77DULL;
            aOrbiterE = RotL64((aOrbiterE * 0x7D75E6B9C19C89D3ULL), 11U);
            //
            aOrbiterG = ((aOrbiterG + aOrbiterE) + 0x62DDA76AAF6DB02EULL) + aKeyRotateOrbiterUpdateSaltD[(((31U - aIndex) + 17U)) & S_SALT1];
            aOrbiterH = (aOrbiterH ^ aOrbiterG) ^ 0xD61C46265A2763C5ULL;
